rem Unfair Wager
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=436

use numbers
use io
use cli

option Digits integer = 10

rem Louise's last draw x and her
rem overshoot w above 1 have density
rem e^(1 + w - x) on 0 <= w <= x <= 1.
rem Julie needs 1 - w more, and the
rem integral over the region gives
rem (1 + 14 e - 5 e^2) / 4.
E = 1.0 exp
P = (1 + 14 * E - 5 * E * E) / 4
Answer = P Digits round
Answer print
